WEBVTT

01:40.750 --> 01:45.850
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.330 --> 01:50.759
[Episode 26]

02:13.650 --> 02:14.580
Mom.

02:15.560 --> 02:16.630
Huaizhu.

02:18.460 --> 02:19.390
Qinlan.

02:22.560 --> 02:23.840
My daughters.

02:30.590 --> 02:31.680
I know.

02:33.030 --> 02:36.870
You must have many questions now.

02:39.030 --> 02:40.030
Then I…

02:41.310 --> 02:43.829
will start with the most important things.

02:45.840 --> 02:47.820
I was born in the Beast Kingdom.

02:48.150 --> 02:50.410
I was the Northern Hill Sect's Saintess.

02:51.079 --> 02:52.940
However, the so-called Saintess

02:53.190 --> 02:55.920
was nothing
but a pitiful sacrificial offering.

02:56.870 --> 03:00.120
Back then, at our sacred place,
we buried 10,000 lives

03:00.150 --> 03:01.960
to seal Jia Lan and Jiuhuo.

03:02.560 --> 03:04.560
But that resulted in lingering resentment

03:04.560 --> 03:05.780
and unrest.

03:06.190 --> 03:07.190
To calm

03:07.630 --> 03:10.920
the vengeful spirits,
my sect had to offer up Saintesses.

03:12.080 --> 03:14.010
None of the sacrificed Saintesses

03:14.280 --> 03:16.280
ever came out alive.

03:16.360 --> 03:17.840
If you want to kill me,

03:17.960 --> 03:19.190
just do it now.

03:19.750 --> 03:21.280
Stop hiding in the shadows.

03:21.800 --> 03:23.890
You're quite calm,

03:24.240 --> 03:27.400
not like the others, sobbing and begging.

03:28.680 --> 03:29.750
Do you want to live?

03:30.180 --> 03:31.400
If possible,

03:32.560 --> 03:33.960
who doesn't want to live?

03:34.079 --> 03:35.540
You're straightforward.

03:36.280 --> 03:38.410
Then I'll just be as straightforward—

03:39.120 --> 03:42.250
I left behind a shard of my soul here.

03:42.750 --> 03:44.840
If your body can withstand it

03:45.430 --> 03:47.230
and carry me out of this dungeon,

03:48.000 --> 03:49.700
not only will you survive,

03:50.240 --> 03:53.750
but I can also give you everything you want.

03:55.190 --> 03:56.850
Then what are you waiting for?

03:58.930 --> 04:02.560
The problem is,
none of the others could endure it.

04:02.750 --> 04:04.480
They all died horrible deaths.

04:05.450 --> 04:06.290
Do it now!

04:15.360 --> 04:16.500
Very well.

04:17.920 --> 04:22.040
I like that spirit of yours.

04:23.800 --> 04:26.680
Your body is not worthy to be my vessel.

04:27.750 --> 04:29.890
I want you to go to the Divine Fire Villa

04:30.000 --> 04:32.930
and bear a daughter
with Dongfang Spiritual Blood.

04:33.360 --> 04:37.140
Use her blood to nourish my soul shard.

04:37.680 --> 04:40.390
She'll be my perfect vessel.

04:41.560 --> 04:44.320
D-Divine Fire Villa?

04:46.070 --> 04:48.080
You think that's somewhere

04:48.600 --> 04:50.040
I can just walk into?

04:50.870 --> 04:52.740
Dongfang Churi

04:53.040 --> 04:55.980
is the current
acting warden of the Huntian Prison.

04:56.900 --> 04:58.360
He's unmarried.

05:00.750 --> 05:03.150
I did everything I could
to get close to him.

05:04.280 --> 05:05.920
I deceived him.

05:07.680 --> 05:10.440
He even left the Yiqi Alliance for me.

05:12.490 --> 05:13.400
However,

05:16.510 --> 05:20.980
the heart isn't something you can predict.

05:23.190 --> 05:24.510
I fell in love with him.

05:26.920 --> 05:30.000
And then I found out
I was pregnant with you, Huaizhu.

05:36.070 --> 05:37.390
Jiang Juanxue.

05:39.870 --> 05:41.810
You've fallen for that man.

05:46.680 --> 05:50.240
Are you going to betray me for him?

05:52.430 --> 05:53.360
Yes.

05:55.310 --> 05:57.560
I won't be controlled by you anymore.

05:58.000 --> 06:00.950
I'm going to tell Churi everything!

06:00.970 --> 06:02.090
Is that so?

06:16.360 --> 06:19.400
Isn't it beautiful, Jiang Juanxue?

06:21.070 --> 06:24.490
You know nothing about my power.

06:26.040 --> 06:28.220
If I controlled your body

06:28.630 --> 06:33.020
and drove your hand
through your beloved man's chest,

06:33.310 --> 06:34.850
that scene

06:35.040 --> 06:37.170
would be way more beautiful than this.

06:40.430 --> 06:42.270
But I was threatened by her.

06:43.659 --> 06:45.790
I had no choice but to give birth to you.

06:46.880 --> 06:48.880
The Black Fox's soul shard

06:48.900 --> 06:50.880
entered your body.

06:51.390 --> 06:52.590
Huaizhu,

06:53.390 --> 06:55.270
everything you've been through

06:55.270 --> 06:57.530
is all because of me!

06:59.750 --> 07:01.120
I understand.

07:02.870 --> 07:04.380
I don't blame you.

07:09.550 --> 07:11.700
She sleeps within you,

07:12.800 --> 07:15.130
drawing power from your Spiritual Blood.

07:16.950 --> 07:17.750
Later,

07:19.120 --> 07:20.950
I found the Twilight Mist Flower

07:22.070 --> 07:23.360
and came here.

07:25.720 --> 07:26.750
When I learned

07:27.950 --> 07:31.300
that I had to sacrifice
all my spiritual energy

07:32.360 --> 07:34.070
and even my life

07:34.070 --> 07:36.200
to make the Twilight Mist Flower grow,

07:37.510 --> 07:38.800
I realized

07:40.560 --> 07:43.320
I couldn't be there for you till the end.

07:47.980 --> 07:49.680
When I left this place

07:52.080 --> 07:54.500
and returned to the Divine Fire Villa,

07:56.270 --> 07:58.150
I was already dying.

07:59.830 --> 08:01.420
At that time, Qinlan…

08:04.000 --> 08:05.750
was only six years old.

08:06.790 --> 08:09.120
Too young to understand anything.

08:11.270 --> 08:12.370
So,

08:12.750 --> 08:14.730
I wrote this letter

08:16.200 --> 08:18.050
for you, Huaizhu.

08:22.120 --> 08:23.950
It's the last thing

08:25.750 --> 08:27.510
I could do for you.

08:29.750 --> 08:32.110
Absorb this Twilight Mist Flower

08:33.120 --> 08:34.650
and fuse it into your blood.

08:36.120 --> 08:39.150
It'll help you suppress the Black Fox forever,

08:39.549 --> 08:41.840
keeping her soul shard from awakening.

08:51.440 --> 08:52.510
Alright.

08:54.840 --> 08:56.840
That's all I have to say.

08:59.080 --> 09:00.480
It's time to say goodbye.

09:03.650 --> 09:04.840
Daughters,

09:05.360 --> 09:07.150
remember this always—

09:08.860 --> 09:10.450
parting is sorrowful,

09:11.730 --> 09:13.990
but it also brings new hope.

09:16.670 --> 09:18.410
When you go back,

09:20.750 --> 09:22.660
make sure to

09:24.040 --> 09:26.700
give your father a big hug for me.

09:34.720 --> 09:35.600
Mother!

09:57.270 --> 09:58.120
Mother.

10:00.510 --> 10:01.850
One day,

10:03.970 --> 10:06.140
I'll kill the Black Fox.

10:17.910 --> 10:19.140
Wangquan Hongye.

10:19.270 --> 10:20.760
Long time no see.

10:20.870 --> 10:22.130
Is this how you greet me

10:22.590 --> 10:24.140
after all this time?

10:24.790 --> 10:27.650
Cut the crap.
Hand over the Twilight Mist Flower.

10:27.910 --> 10:29.370
And I'll spare your lives.

10:30.080 --> 10:31.870
If you want
the Twilight Mist Flower so badly,

10:31.870 --> 10:33.270
why didn't you get it yourself?

10:33.270 --> 10:34.720
She's afraid of being judged as evil

10:34.720 --> 10:35.920
and getting trapped.

10:36.550 --> 10:37.320
No wonder.

10:37.630 --> 10:39.690
Mind your words in front of the ruler!

10:39.720 --> 10:40.930
If that's the case,

10:41.150 --> 10:42.610
don't blame me

10:42.720 --> 10:45.680
for settling
both old and new scores with you.

10:46.790 --> 10:47.880
Settling scores?

10:49.640 --> 10:50.840
Are you going to tear up

10:50.840 --> 10:53.270
the agreement
between the Yiqi Alliance and the Beast Kingdom

10:53.270 --> 10:54.800
and turn against Wangquan?

10:55.170 --> 10:56.430
Not Wangquan.

10:56.910 --> 10:59.820
Today, we're slaying a snake demon.

11:03.870 --> 11:05.270
This is your last chance.

11:05.870 --> 11:07.330
The Twilight Mist Flower—

11:07.510 --> 11:09.040
will you hand it over or not?

11:10.390 --> 11:12.390
Zhang Zheng, come out now.

11:21.020 --> 11:21.840
Zhang Zheng.

11:21.870 --> 11:23.340
Can you do me a favor?

11:23.510 --> 11:24.320
What is it?

11:24.560 --> 11:28.270
I'm going to participate
in the Demon Fight at the Drunken Dream Tower later.

11:28.270 --> 11:29.550
Tell Anayan

11:29.550 --> 11:30.840
you'll leave first

11:31.040 --> 11:34.040
and then return to help me
on the day of the Demon Fight.

11:35.800 --> 11:37.130
Dark Sword Zhang Zheng?

11:38.670 --> 11:41.720
Anayan, didn't you say he was on your side?

11:44.070 --> 11:46.210
Wangquan Sword, Dark Sword,

11:46.280 --> 11:47.540
Dongfang Divine Fire,

11:47.560 --> 11:49.150
and the Li family from Peach Garden.

11:49.150 --> 11:50.770
Do you really think your men

11:50.840 --> 11:52.780
have any chance of killing me?

11:53.510 --> 11:55.370
If we return to the Yiqi Alliance,

11:55.510 --> 11:56.390
Your Majesty,

11:56.870 --> 11:58.800
what do you think will happen next?

12:03.030 --> 12:03.910
Guards!

12:05.600 --> 12:06.910
Seize Anayan!

12:07.740 --> 12:09.490
You useless fool!

12:09.620 --> 12:11.860
Terrified after just a few words?

12:11.960 --> 12:14.150
You don't deserve
to be the ruler of the Beast Kingdom!

12:14.150 --> 12:15.030
Move aside!

12:21.360 --> 12:22.030
Guards!

12:22.030 --> 12:22.390
Yes!

12:22.390 --> 12:24.000
Take this vicious woman away

12:24.120 --> 12:25.450
and put her on death row!

12:25.470 --> 12:26.120
Yes!

12:27.440 --> 12:28.030
Move!

12:30.280 --> 12:31.740
Then let this farce

12:31.800 --> 12:33.030
end here.

12:34.120 --> 12:34.960
Alright.

12:35.150 --> 12:37.210
Our operations in the Beast Kingdom…

12:37.360 --> 12:38.890
You can do whatever you want

12:39.320 --> 12:40.720
and go wherever you want.

12:45.080 --> 12:45.960
Let's go.

13:10.910 --> 13:13.620
Absorb this Twilight Mist Flower

13:13.840 --> 13:15.370
and fuse it into your blood.

13:17.270 --> 13:20.240
It'll help you suppress the Black Fox forever,

13:20.390 --> 13:22.790
keeping her soul shard from awakening.

13:25.730 --> 13:30.260
This Black Fox's soul shard
will sink with me

13:31.040 --> 13:32.910
into eternal slumber.

13:34.090 --> 13:35.720
Dongfang Huaizhu,

13:36.100 --> 13:38.140
you'll be free soon.

14:03.390 --> 14:04.510
How is it?

14:04.510 --> 14:06.120
Is the Twilight Mist Flower working?

14:06.120 --> 14:08.650
It still needs some time
to be fully absorbed.

14:09.840 --> 14:11.240
You've been out here this whole time?

14:11.240 --> 14:12.440
I was worried.

14:17.550 --> 14:20.390
This is Wangquan Hongye's inner struggle.

14:21.600 --> 14:23.120
Look at his face.

14:23.610 --> 14:24.730
Is it frightening?

14:28.750 --> 14:29.670
Huaizhu.

14:37.750 --> 14:38.550
Huaizhu?

14:44.150 --> 14:45.480
Let's go sit for a while.

14:56.550 --> 14:58.670
In the illusion of the Twilight Mist Flower,

14:58.670 --> 15:00.070
what did you see about me?

15:07.790 --> 15:09.050
Was it my past?

15:13.640 --> 15:15.340
When did that happen?

15:18.600 --> 15:19.550
When I was 16.

15:21.030 --> 15:23.000
After my father left

15:23.790 --> 15:25.450
with the real Wangquan Sword.

15:28.440 --> 15:29.720
And from that day on,

15:30.640 --> 15:32.260
you were always on edge,

15:32.670 --> 15:34.000
surrounded by enemies,

15:35.200 --> 15:36.800
and too afraid to even sleep.

15:38.960 --> 15:41.030
At that time, it was really…

15:41.750 --> 15:43.510
quite overwhelming for me.

15:48.320 --> 15:49.840
Yet after going through all that,

15:49.840 --> 15:51.770
you still became who you are today.

15:52.630 --> 15:55.290
It's truly impressive.

15:57.390 --> 15:58.440
So,

15:59.510 --> 16:00.840
you've got great taste.

16:06.550 --> 16:08.200
Two people's shoulders

16:08.960 --> 16:11.030
can carry much more than one's.

16:13.270 --> 16:14.550
In the days to come,

16:15.720 --> 16:17.200
let me share your burden.

16:22.240 --> 16:23.030
Alright.

17:30.360 --> 17:32.330
♪ How can the wind stop? ♪

17:32.990 --> 17:35.450
♪ How can clouds stop for us? ♪

17:36.060 --> 17:39.780
♪ The vicissitudes of life never cease ♪

17:40.930 --> 17:45.310
♪ The time we spend together is too short and unreal ♪

17:46.240 --> 17:50.280
♪ You blur into a shadow near me ♪

17:51.370 --> 17:53.370
♪ We're fully committed ♪

17:53.910 --> 17:55.710
♪ We're wholly devoted ♪

17:56.730 --> 18:00.460
♪ Love has us spellbound ♪

18:01.310 --> 18:03.530
♪ We're lost in a wasteland ♪

18:04.020 --> 18:06.400
♪ A lonely boat lies around ♪

18:07.430 --> 18:11.740
♪ To the moon I tell how much I miss you ♪

18:13.580 --> 18:18.020
♪ My passion for you never fades ♪

18:18.660 --> 18:21.260
♪ It's a guardian angel ♪

18:21.680 --> 18:23.670
♪ Hovering high in the sky ♪

18:24.410 --> 18:26.370
♪ Time goes by ♪

18:26.910 --> 18:28.890
♪ Stars twinkle and dim ♪

18:29.630 --> 18:33.060
♪ But our love remains still ♪

18:34.590 --> 18:38.970
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

18:39.870 --> 18:42.430
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

18:43.140 --> 18:45.040
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

18:45.570 --> 18:47.240
♪ But everywhere I see ♪

18:47.980 --> 18:49.790
♪ Your image sticks around ♪

18:50.420 --> 18:54.010
♪ Holding your hands, I can't speak a word ♪

19:15.820 --> 19:17.720
♪ We're fully committed ♪

19:18.360 --> 19:20.260
♪ We're wholly devoted ♪

19:21.180 --> 19:25.070
♪ Love has us spellbound ♪

19:25.530 --> 19:28.010
♪ We're lost in a wasteland ♪

19:28.590 --> 19:30.760
♪ A lonely boat lies around ♪

19:31.740 --> 19:36.060
♪ To the moon I tell how much I miss you ♪

19:38.030 --> 19:42.470
♪ My passion for you never fades ♪

19:43.110 --> 19:45.530
♪ It's a guardian angel ♪

19:46.130 --> 19:48.090
♪ Hovering high in the sky ♪

19:48.550 --> 19:49.680
You've finished drawing them?

19:48.860 --> 19:50.810
♪ Time goes by ♪

19:51.570 --> 19:53.410
♪ Stars twinkle and dim ♪

19:54.080 --> 19:57.460
♪ But our love remains still ♪

19:55.790 --> 19:56.790
Classmate Zhang,

19:57.510 --> 19:59.790
why is your face so red?

19:59.040 --> 20:03.420
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

20:01.590 --> 20:02.830
Is it that hot today?

20:04.160 --> 20:06.710
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

20:07.250 --> 20:09.260
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

20:09.720 --> 20:11.640
♪ But everywhere I see ♪

20:12.170 --> 20:14.090
♪ Your image sticks around ♪

20:14.680 --> 20:18.120
♪ Holding your hands, I can't speak a word ♪

20:41.350 --> 20:45.260
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

20:46.700 --> 20:48.930
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

20:49.050 --> 20:50.160
You already came.

20:49.600 --> 20:51.610
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

20:52.270 --> 20:53.940
♪ The past vanishes ♪

20:53.370 --> 20:55.340
Why didn't you dare to have a drink with me?

20:54.440 --> 20:56.290
♪ Like a dream and a whiff of smoke ♪

20:57.050 --> 21:00.940
♪ I hope to see you again in the next life, if there is one ♪

21:00.240 --> 21:01.030
Never mind.

21:03.960 --> 21:06.020
When we get back to the Yiqi Alliance,

21:06.440 --> 21:07.830
I'll deal with you then.

21:55.240 --> 21:56.590
Jin Renfeng.

21:58.030 --> 21:59.030
Lord Jiuhuo.

22:00.510 --> 22:03.200
I'm indeed very weak at the moment,

22:04.570 --> 22:06.130
but killing you

22:08.000 --> 22:10.830
is still as easy as crushing an ant.

22:12.550 --> 22:14.070
Lord Jiuhuo, you have

22:15.160 --> 22:16.360
my absolute loyalty.

22:18.640 --> 22:21.470
Anayan is so useless.

22:21.830 --> 22:23.290
You still want to save her?

22:23.440 --> 22:24.810
She still has her uses.

22:27.360 --> 22:28.520
Mu Kaiqi!

22:28.880 --> 22:30.390
Come out here!

22:30.680 --> 22:32.930
Stop hiding like a coward!

22:33.110 --> 22:35.170
Do you hear me, Mukaiqi?

22:35.200 --> 22:36.560
Come out here!

22:37.430 --> 22:38.660
You ungrateful traitor

22:38.660 --> 22:40.190
who walked out on your ally!

22:41.530 --> 22:44.780
As long as I'm still breathing,

22:44.800 --> 22:47.100
I'll make you pay!

22:47.840 --> 22:49.380
Big words for someone

22:49.850 --> 22:51.370
with not much life left.

22:52.930 --> 22:53.850
Who are you?

22:56.960 --> 22:58.650
Your master.

23:01.870 --> 23:03.110
Lord Jiuhuo.

23:03.850 --> 23:04.810
Save me.

23:05.550 --> 23:06.880
Save me.

23:07.070 --> 23:08.400
But Jin Renfeng said

23:09.510 --> 23:11.000
you wouldn't submit to me.

23:11.160 --> 23:12.090
That's not true.

23:13.000 --> 23:15.880
I've always been loyal to you, My Lord.

23:16.200 --> 23:18.330
It's just that I'm not powerful enough

23:18.400 --> 23:22.000
to beat Wangquan Hongye
and Dongfang Huaizhu…

23:26.240 --> 23:28.000
This is the Resentment Bell.

23:31.350 --> 23:33.960
It can help you conquer the Beast Kingdom.

23:36.970 --> 23:38.430
What's all this noise?

23:39.350 --> 23:41.880
Who are you? How did you get in here?

23:42.510 --> 23:43.680
Go try it out.

24:01.510 --> 24:03.200
Sky City…

24:05.790 --> 24:06.790
I

24:11.540 --> 24:12.790
have returned.

24:19.880 --> 24:21.310
Little fox?

24:22.200 --> 24:23.330
Does it look like me?

24:24.400 --> 24:25.240
Yes.

24:40.240 --> 24:41.640
Lord Jiuhuo,

24:42.790 --> 24:45.390
Wangquan Hongye and Dongfang Huaizhu

24:45.590 --> 24:47.850
have obtained the Twilight Mist Flower.

24:48.510 --> 24:51.550
Isn't that Anayan too stupid?

24:52.070 --> 24:52.960
Don't worry.

24:54.310 --> 24:55.590
I know what I'm doing.

24:56.680 --> 24:58.540
Your injuries are too severe now.

24:58.680 --> 25:00.880
You can no longer use your demonic energy,

25:00.880 --> 25:02.350
or you won't survive.

25:03.720 --> 25:05.200
If we can't count on you

25:05.240 --> 25:06.990
or Anayan,

25:07.200 --> 25:09.340
just let Jin Renfeng give it a shot.

25:09.510 --> 25:11.880
We don't have the time
to sit around and wait.

25:11.880 --> 25:14.550
No, it's not that I don't trust him.

25:15.640 --> 25:18.960
It's that Wangquan Hongye
is not so easy to deal with.

25:20.510 --> 25:21.970
I lost the previous battle

25:22.010 --> 25:24.010
because I underestimated him.

25:24.070 --> 25:25.240
One wrong move

25:26.310 --> 25:28.370
led to the entire plan falling apart.

25:28.680 --> 25:30.640
Alright, I'll listen to you.

25:31.720 --> 25:33.070
But we don't have much time left

25:33.070 --> 25:34.350
to waste.

25:35.030 --> 25:38.720
I hope you can play a good game
against Wangquan Hongye.

25:48.720 --> 25:51.170
Even if I lost all my demonic energy,

25:52.830 --> 25:56.350
I'd still take one more gamble for you

25:57.150 --> 25:58.690
to wipe out everything

25:59.790 --> 26:01.510
that should've been erased

26:01.960 --> 26:04.020
and clear the path ahead completely.

26:13.920 --> 26:15.920
Pour me some wine.

26:32.160 --> 26:33.980
Anayan?

26:35.200 --> 26:36.000
You…

26:45.960 --> 26:47.750
Everyone who betrayed me

26:48.790 --> 26:51.070
has to pay for it.

26:54.400 --> 26:56.740
Now give me

26:58.030 --> 26:59.960
all that royal blood of yours.

27:26.550 --> 27:27.350
What are you doing?

27:27.350 --> 27:28.270
Put that down.

27:28.270 --> 27:30.350
Don't touch Miss Qingmu's stuff,

27:30.440 --> 27:31.750
or she'll beat you up.

27:33.080 --> 27:35.010
Young Master Li, that's nonsense.

27:35.070 --> 27:37.370
Qinlan, if you like that fan,

27:37.550 --> 27:38.720
you can have it.

27:41.590 --> 27:44.200
So only when I break your stuff,

27:44.200 --> 27:45.330
I get beaten up, huh?

27:45.510 --> 27:47.160
Puppy Li, don't be angry.

27:47.270 --> 27:49.080
Let me, your master, fan you.

27:49.200 --> 27:52.070
Cut it out. I'm not a dog demon anymore.

27:52.200 --> 27:53.550
Call me Young Master Li.

27:54.350 --> 27:56.030
Once a dog,

27:56.070 --> 27:57.750
always a dog.

27:57.880 --> 27:58.590
You…

27:59.030 --> 27:59.830
Alright.

28:00.160 --> 28:01.680
We've finished
our business in the Beast Kingdom.

28:01.680 --> 28:04.240
We've got everything we came for.

28:04.960 --> 28:08.110
Today, Ruyi Pavilion is reserved
to give everyone a proper send-off.

28:08.110 --> 28:09.410
A send-off?

28:09.680 --> 28:12.210
Then we're still missing someone important.

28:12.920 --> 28:15.720
That blockhead won't be able to escape.

28:16.640 --> 28:19.240
Once I purge
the demon poison, I'll go find him.

28:19.680 --> 28:20.890
Bad news, bad news!

28:21.110 --> 28:22.550
The ruler of the Beast Kingdom
has been killed!

28:22.550 --> 28:23.720
The killer is still at large.

28:23.720 --> 28:24.920
The ruler's brother, Prince Bumu,

28:24.920 --> 28:27.120
has sealed off the entire Grand Palace.

28:29.830 --> 28:30.960
Let's go take a look.

28:31.110 --> 28:32.110
I'll go too.

28:33.110 --> 28:33.790
Me too.

28:33.880 --> 28:34.760
Me too.

28:34.880 --> 28:36.660
Qinlan, you stay here.

28:36.960 --> 28:38.030
Quzhuo, you stay here too.

28:38.030 --> 28:38.700
Why…

28:39.000 --> 28:40.600
Why can you bring Miss Qingmu

28:40.610 --> 28:41.810
but not me?

28:42.030 --> 28:44.240
Because I bring good fortune wherever I go.

28:44.240 --> 28:45.640
I'm more useful than you.

29:47.920 --> 29:50.990
Oh, vengeful spirits dormant for centuries,

29:51.700 --> 29:57.140
today you shall heed my command.

30:16.250 --> 30:17.200
Anayan!

30:17.200 --> 30:19.290
You assassinated the ruler
and released evil spirits!

30:19.290 --> 30:20.440
Your crimes are unforgivable!

30:20.440 --> 30:22.290
Unforgivable?

30:23.110 --> 30:26.500
I'd love to see how exactly.

30:35.890 --> 30:38.090
Forsaking emotions, pursuing hatred;

30:38.330 --> 30:40.090
eternal night befalls.

30:41.530 --> 30:42.560
Go.

30:42.590 --> 30:45.570
Kill all living beings in the Beast Kingdom.

30:58.050 --> 30:59.670
Perfect timing.

31:00.680 --> 31:04.680
These spirits
can instantly drain all life force.

31:05.030 --> 31:06.770
Touch them and you die.

31:07.400 --> 31:10.470
You're all going to die!

31:15.960 --> 31:16.790
Be careful!

31:33.570 --> 31:34.830
Everyone, be careful!

31:34.890 --> 31:36.260
Spiritual energy doesn't work here.

31:36.260 --> 31:38.320
Don't let the evil spirits touch you!

32:17.160 --> 32:18.210
Yuan,

32:18.230 --> 32:20.560
find a way to break that magical artifact.

32:39.340 --> 32:41.790
This magical artifact
suppresses spiritual energy,

32:41.790 --> 32:44.420
but these spirits
are likely formed from demonic resentment.

32:44.420 --> 32:47.130
Perhaps demonic energy can break it.

32:47.680 --> 32:48.810
Let me give it a try.

32:51.420 --> 32:54.260
This bracelet can suppress
the demon poison in you.

32:54.260 --> 32:56.300
You must not take it off
until you find the antidote.

32:56.300 --> 32:57.100
If you do,

32:57.130 --> 32:59.460
the demon poison will act up immediately.

33:13.450 --> 33:19.620
♪ All my wild wishes can never come true ♪

33:20.710 --> 33:26.780
♪ If we part ways, how clear-headed would I be on my own? ♪

33:27.320 --> 33:33.140
♪ With this body and heart I search ♪

33:27.970 --> 33:28.640
Yuan!

33:28.750 --> 33:29.400
Yuan!

33:33.860 --> 33:37.210
♪ Kindling fire with love ♪

33:36.850 --> 33:37.620
No.

33:37.890 --> 33:41.210
♪ It neither dims nor extinguished ♪

33:38.030 --> 33:39.800
Although the Resentment Bell is broken,

33:39.800 --> 33:42.260
these evil spirits have gone out of control.

35:04.000 --> 35:04.710
Huaizhu.

35:10.880 --> 35:11.640
Huaizhu.

35:17.680 --> 35:18.850
I'm fine.

35:19.740 --> 35:21.720
We protected everyone.

35:24.840 --> 35:25.920
Except for one.
